-	SETTING("experimental.event_waits_when_hot", "Experimental", "FPS Experiments", "Event waits when hot", "Once the iPhone reports a serious thermal state, three short waits of the emulator (a write lock waiting for the PPU threads to stop, a PPU thread waiting for that lock, the RSX waiting for new commands) sleep the CPU core until the awaited write instead of spinning on it. They wait for the same thing, for the same time at most. Automatic: from the serious thermal state. Enabled: always. Disabled: never, the previous waits. Takes effect on the next boot.", kind::RPCS3_IOS_SETTING_CHOICE, g_cfg.ios_experimental.event_waits_when_hot, 0, 0, 0),
+	SETTING("experimental.event_waits_when_hot", "Experimental", "FPS Experiments", "Event waits when hot", "Once the iPhone reports a serious thermal state, three short waits of the emulator (a write lock waiting for the PPU threads to stop, a PPU thread waiting for that lock, the RSX waiting for new commands) sleep the CPU core until the awaited write instead of spinning on it. They wait for the same thing, for the same time at most. Automatic: always once the start-up self-test has found that the wait rests the core (Core 945), otherwise from the serious thermal state. Enabled: always. Disabled: never, the previous waits. Takes effect on the next boot.", kind::RPCS3_IOS_SETTING_CHOICE, g_cfg.ios_experimental.event_waits_when_hot, 0, 0, 0),
 	GAME_SETTING("experimental.put_epoch_horizon", "Experimental", "FPS Experiments", "Texture epoch at the PUT horizon", "With Texture Validation Per FIFO Batch, every new batch of guest commands the RSX noticed made every texture check its contents again, even while the RSX was still executing commands published earlier. The recheck now starts when the RSX reaches the first command that was not yet published at the previous one; semaphores, RSX writes and the end of a frame recheck as before. Every texture is still checked before any command published after its last check uses it. Automatic enables it for God of War III and Call of Duty: Black Ops II; Disabled rechecks at every batch noticed, as before. Takes effect on the next boot.", kind::RPCS3_IOS_SETTING_CHOICE, g_cfg.ios_experimental.put_epoch_horizon, 0, 0, 0),
